        <div>
          <div class="about-content reveal reveal-delay-1">
            <p data-en="I'm a 4th-year engineering student at <strong>CPE Lyon</strong> (top French digital science school), specializing in Software Design and Big Data. I'm genuinely passionate about how software, data, and AI are reshaping the future." data-fr="Je suis étudiant ingénieur en 4ème année à <strong>CPE Lyon</strong> (top école française en sciences numériques), spécialisé en Conception Logicielle et Big Data. Je suis vraiment passionné par la façon dont le logiciel, la data et l'IA reconfigurent le futur.">I'm a 4th-year engineering student at <strong>CPE Lyon</strong> (top French digital science school), specializing in Software Design and Big Data. I'm genuinely passionate about how software, data, and AI are reshaping the future.</p>
            <p data-en="Beyond academics, I build <strong>AI agents and multi-agent pipelines</strong> — experimenting with orchestrator/worker patterns, MCP and A2A protocols, callback architectures, and AWS integrations. I see AI not just as a tool, but as a new programming paradigm." data-fr="Au-delà des cours, je construis des <strong>agents IA et des pipelines multi-agents</strong> — j'expérimente des patterns orchestrateur/worker, les protocoles MCP &amp; A2A, les architectures callback, et les intégrations AWS. Je vois l'IA comme un nouveau paradigme.">Beyond academics, I build <strong>AI agents and multi-agent pipelines</strong> — experimenting with orchestrator/worker patterns, MCP and A2A protocols, callback architectures, and AWS integrations. I see AI not just as a tool, but as a new programming paradigm.</p>
            <p data-en="My experience in hospitality — bartender and youth activity leader — built strong interpersonal skills and resilience that complement my technical expertise perfectly." data-fr="Mon expérience en hôtellerie — barman et animateur jeunesse — a développé de solides compétences interpersonnelles et une résilience qui complètent parfaitement mon expertise technique.">My experience in hospitality — bartender and youth activity leader — built strong interpersonal skills and resilience that complement my technical expertise perfectly.</p>
          </div>
